								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1308.msg12983#msg12983">Re: Relief for us smelly bards.  LOL</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #16 on:</b> December 07, 2004, 06:58:06 pm &#187;</span></td>
